      "text": "Functional Requirements",
      "fontSize": 80.08104509425381,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "gAbZpGSK4hgpeZ5qBfXeo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8976.758467454263,
      "y": -5631.408199333726,
      "width": 2928.11206129364,
      "height": 361.2976694754445,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e6fcf5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "n0WUpLSVBzPdWLj3KFJYY",
        "UvxfZgaKZnos7b2QN6nzX"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bkr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2119941900,
      "version": 522,
      "versionNonce": 345882380,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795777231044,
      "created": 1795772344776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Local JWT sign-up/login, Google OAuth2 linking, and SMTP password reset.\n2. 7-node LangGraph pipeline to search YouTube, extract transcripts, score, rank, and generate reports.\n3. Scoped Q&A (none / video / all) over SSE with timestamped video & web citations.\n4. Live web search/scraping (DuckDuckGo + Firecrawl) and isolated Python/C++ code execution (E2B).\n5. History management (pin/archive/delete), 2D knowledge graphs, public share links, and chat forking.",
      "fontSize": 57.80762711607111,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Local JWT sign-up/login, Google OAuth2 linking, and SMTP password reset.\n2. 7-node LangGraph pipeline to search YouTube, extract transcripts, score, rank, and generate reports.\n3. Scoped Q&A (none / video / all) over SSE with timestamped video & web citations.\n4. Live web search/scraping (DuckDuckGo + Firecrawl) and isolated Python/C++ code execution (E2B).\n5. History management (pin/archive/delete), 2D knowledge graphs, public share links, and chat forking.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LK4DFuNJFsN78bsJANmQD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8972.167865365453,
      "y": -5106.242914312375,
      "width": 1111.9360068318379,
      "height": 100.10130636781726,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e6fcf5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "lCasK1tZ2IOQJndrT3OYN",
        "UvxfZgaKZnos7b2QN6nzX"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bks",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1675995956,
      "version": 506,
      "versionNonce": 1550485428,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795777231044,
      "created": 1795772469082,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional Requirements",
      "fontSize": 80.08104509425381,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional Requirements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ShJv28PaGjOTcMHla6438",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8979.356217820377,
      "y": -4968.827818323577,
      "width": 2978.1093805174582,
      "height": 361.2976694754445,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#e6fcf5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "lCasK1tZ2IOQJndrT3OYN",
        "UvxfZgaKZnos7b2QN6nzX"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bkt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 99755188,
      "version": 613,
      "versionNonce": 1529478540,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795777231044,
      "created": 1795772469082,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. pwdlib password hashing, SHA-256 refresh/reset tokens, JWTs, and E2B micro-VM code isolation.\n2. DualLLM & DualEmbedding automatic failover (OpenAI → Gemini) + 30s multi-tab refresh grace window.\n3. Async FastAPI + asyncpg, SelectiveGZip (bypasses SSE /stream), and pgvector + GIN hybrid indexing.\n4. Per-route SlowAPI token-bucket limits (5/hr register, 5/min research, 15/min chat)..\n5. structlog JSON telemetry, Docker Compose (dev), Cloud Run + Vercel + Supabase Pooler (prod).",
      "fontSize": 57.807627116071124,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. pwdlib password hashing, SHA-256 refresh/reset tokens, JWTs, and E2B micro-VM code isolation.\n2. DualLLM & DualEmbedding automatic failover (OpenAI → Gemini) + 30s multi-tab refresh grace window.\n3. Async FastAPI + asyncpg, SelectiveGZip (bypasses SSE /stream), and pgvector + GIN hybrid indexing.\n4. Per-route SlowAPI token-bucket limits (5/hr register, 5/min research, 15/min chat)..\n5. structlog JSON telemetry, Docker Compose (dev), Cloud Run + Vercel + Supabase Pooler (prod).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
